WEBVTT

NOTE DRAFT only. Timing has not been synchronized to a final encoded MP4. Do not publish as verified captions.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
A memory can feel perfectly clear.
Clarity is not the same as proof.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
In 1974, researchers changed a single word in a question about a filmed accident.
Later reports changed too.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:26.000
What you noticed and what you were asked afterward are different pieces of evidence.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Before any paid audio, try twelve quiet minutes.
Observe. Write down what you actually noticed.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Then read the evidence and decide for yourself.
Final Vestige. Research before recommendation.
